        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is under attack from an advanced alien technology they use portals to quickly spread across the world and destroy everything on a global scale. But they didn’t count on an unlikely heroine and her nerdy little companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the invasion, unlock new technology, and keep moving!  The world needs you! Groundskeeper throws you in the middle of a war, the war with supernatural robots from outer space. Yeah, we went there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.poster.avif?t=1786438836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.webm?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.mp4?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you play this game, you will get further and have a better chance at surviving. You’ll perma-unlock new weapons like the machine gun, laser gun, and rocket launcher, as well as tools like the all-destroying light beams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll be able to grab useful items like shields, time-slowdowns, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s more important: you’ll unlock new worlds and hopefully become a true hero for the resistance… as you bring the fight to the planet of the invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…or you die a quick death and try again..!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.poster.avif?t=1786438836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.webm?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.mp4?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast old-school Arcade game play style. This is designed for quick, short gameplay sessions that always run longer than you planned!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perma unlock weapon upgrades, special power-ups, and new worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy retro soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful graphics and fun voice-acted tutorial cut-scenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.poster.avif?t=1786438836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.webm?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.mp4?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is under attack from an advanced alien technology they use portals to quickly spread across the world and destroy everything on a global scale. But they didn’t count on an unlikely heroine and her nerdy little companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the invasion, unlock new technology, and keep moving!  The world needs you! Groundskeeper throws you in the middle of a war, the war with supernatural robots from outer space. Yeah, we went there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.poster.avif?t=1786438836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.webm?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/53be50154407a2ceaaa28b36aa505e73.mp4?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you play this game, you will get further and have a better chance at surviving. You’ll perma-unlock new weapons like the machine gun, laser gun, and rocket launcher, as well as tools like the all-destroying light beams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll be able to grab useful items like shields, time-slowdowns, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s more important: you’ll unlock new worlds and hopefully become a true hero for the resistance… as you bring the fight to the planet of the invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…or you die a quick death and try again..!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.poster.avif?t=1786438836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.webm?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/4b10c35b46568dbc5a35af42a0e1b218.mp4?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast old-school Arcade game play style. This is designed for quick, short gameplay sessions that always run longer than you planned!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perma unlock weapon upgrades, special power-ups, and new worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy retro soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful graphics and fun voice-acted tutorial cut-scenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.poster.avif?t=1786438836\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.webm?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875340/extras/b2d2443d4cb3f59ac00f0f3d5b8b8acb.mp4?t=1786438836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
